import LOEIS.A105.A105256.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A105256

Sign doubling substitution of the Rauzy: 1->{1,2},2->{1,3},3->1 using a digraphy symmetry to the bi-Kenyon version (not a triangular nest of nests, but a straight level 5).

The 105 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A105256

